                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "One of the greatest games ever made. Extremely deep world and lore. Brilliant level design if you actually engage with it instead of trying to run from bonfire to bonfire like slop souls 3. The atmosphere is probably the best part of this game you go to very different places but it still always feels like you are inside a dream which as far as i know connect to the lore. Never listen to people who say skip dark souls 2",
